# Frozen sources are byte-exact inputs. Their SHA-256 is recorded in
# sources/MANIFEST.json and checked by scripts/verify-sources.mjs, so any
# line-ending conversion on checkout would change the bytes, change the hashes,
# and fail verification on a fresh clone. Disable all text conversion here.
sources/** -text

# The superseded pipeline component kept at the repo root is a historical copy;
# treat it the same way so it stays comparable to the frozen revision.
SystemPromptBuilderPipeline.tsx -text
